# managed by arch-dotfiles/apparmor
# apparmor.d's firefox profile, built, with one change: its attachment. apparmor 4.1.8 loads apparmor.d's
# /{{,usr/}...{,x}...} form but never attaches /usr/lib/firefox/firefox, the desktop file's Exec: launched from there
# firefox ran unconfined and the openers' px into it failed (profile transition not found). aa-install skips its own
# copy (ignore.d, mod.nu); refresh this file from /usr/share/apparmor.d when apparmor.d changes the profile

# apparmor.d - Full set of apparmor profiles
